yEvidence\":true,\"implementationProven\":false,\"runtimeVerified\":false}\nAUTO_COMPOSITION_RULE: For every present feature, edit its real game owner only. Connect existing lobby/customization/material/inventory/equipment/UI/world/biome/housing/motion/action and source-grounded NPC AI/quest/dialogue/crafting/economy/progression/farming/weather/physics/camera/audio/skill effects/network only when game source and approved design contain them. Biomes must map approved regions to real native terrain/navigation/streaming; housing must preserve placement/cost/ownership/save/rejoin; customization must use actual character model and saved identity; motion must drive existing actions and approved hit events; NPC decisions must not grant economy/save/combat authority; crafting and shopping use actual items/currency/state. Use applicable moduleConnections as source-only QA work units, never completed features. Mobile HUD must use real input/state; no dead controls. Trace acquisition→store→equip→visual/stat→save→reconnect with authoritative state; source signatures never pass QA. No new asset generation or shadow system.\nPLAYER_FACING_INSPECTION_CONTRACT:\ninspectionContract=EVERY_CYCLE; EXISTING_BUILD_UP_AND_F0_F9_ONLY; CHECKLIST_NOT_EXECUTED; QUALITY_UNVERIFIED; inspect all applicable surfaces, expand current details from playerFacingInspectionContract; not-applicable needs design/source reason.\ninspectionIndex=UI_LAYOUT:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE|UI_INTERACTION:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE|CHARACTER_RENDER:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE|MONSTER_READABILITY:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE|MOTION_TRANSITIONS:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE\ninspectionIndex=ACTION_IMPACT:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE|CAMERA_COMPOSITION:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE|WORLD_BACKGROUND:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE|GRAPHICS_INTEGRITY:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE|NAVIGATION_BLOCKERS:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE\ninspectionIndex=PROGRESSION_BLOCKERS:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE|RECOVERY_SAVE:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE|MULTIPLAYER_CONSISTENCY:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE|MOBILE_PERFORMANCE:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE|LOBBY_SPACES:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE\ninspectionEvidence=EXACT_GAME_SOURCE_ARTIFACT_VERSION_SCENE_VIEWPORT_INPUT_STATE_CAPTURE_SHA256_FINDING_OWNER_RETEST; compare same scene before/after; motion needs timed frames. Thumbnail/transport/static QA/counts never prove visual quality.\ninspectionRule=Use centrally allowed observation only. Missing exact render stays UNVERIFIED, not an invented defect/PASS. Reproduce real failure, repair existing owner, run impact QA, rebuild/replay same scene; preserve save/balance/server authority.\ninspectionScene=CHARACTER_RENDER:정면/측면/후면, 가까이/멀리, 장비 교체와 이동·경사·착지\ninspectionFailure=CHARACTER_RENDER:누락 메시/텍스처·기본 부품 대체·장비 관통/부유·리그 찢어짐·발 미끄러짐·지면 관통\ninspectionOwner=CHARACTER_RENDER:기존 모델 바인딩·리그·장착 접점·접지\ninspectionRetest=CHARACTER_RENDER:같은 캐릭터/장비/카메라의 실제 렌더와 원본 해시/업로드 ID 연결\ninspectionScene=MONSTER_READABILITY:기존 적 종류를 같은 조명에서 접근→추적→공격 전조→피격→사망 순으로 관찰\ninspectionFailure=MONSTER_READABILITY:색만 다른 복제·역할 식별 불가·공격 전조 안 보임·배경에 묻힘·죽은 적이 움직이거나 남음\ninspectionOwner=MONSTER_READABILITY:적 모델·상태 표현·전조·사망 정리\ninspectionRetest=MONSTER_READABILITY:기존 종류별 역할과 위험 전조가 구별되는 화면/행동 기록\nEXPERIENCE_BUILD_UP: {\"version\":1,\"status\":\"ACTIVE_EXECUTABLE_BUILD_UP_CONTRACT\",\"platform\":\"ROBLOX\",\"focus\":\"PRESENTATION\",\"attention\":\"EXTRA\",\"tracks\":[{\"track\":\"MOTION_AND_ACTING\",\"status\":\"PRESENT\"},{\"track\":\"COMBAT_AND_PRIMARY_ACTION_FEEL\",\"status\":\"PRESENT\"},{\"track\":\"UI_HUD_AND_MENU\",\"status\":\"PRESENT\"},{\"track\":\"INVENTORY_AND_EQUIPMENT\",\"status\":\"PRESENT\"},{\"track\":\"AUDIO_MUSIC_AND_FEEDBACK\",\"status\":\"PRESENT\"},{\"track\":\"VFX_CAMERA_AND_IMPACT_SYNC\",\"status\":\"PRESENT\"},{\"track\":\"WORLD_VISUAL_COHESION\",\"status\":\"PRESENT\"},{\"track\":\"MOBILE_TOUCH_AND_ACCESSIBILITY\",\"status\":\"PRESENT\"},{\"track\":\"PERFORMANCE_AND_RUNTIME_STABILITY\",\"status\":\"PRESENT\"}],\"priorityOrder\":[\"MOTION_AND_ACTING\",\"AUDIO_MUSIC_AND_FEEDBACK\",\"COMBAT_AND_PRIMARY_ACTION_FEEL\",\"UI_HUD_AND_MENU\",\"INVENTORY_AND_EQUIPMENT\",\"VFX_CAMERA_AND_IMPACT_SYNC\",\"WORLD_VISUAL_COHESION\",\"MOBILE_TOUCH_AND_ACCESSIBILITY\",\"PERFORMANCE_AND_RUNTIME_STABILITY\"],\"weakestTracks\":[],\"loop\":[\"OBSERVE_CURRENT_RUNTIME_AND_PLAYER_FLOW\",\"RANK_WEAKEST_APPLICABLE_TRACKS\",\"IMPLEMENT_EXISTING_RESPONSIBLE_SYSTEMS_DIRECTLY\",\"REPLAY_REAL_INPUTS_AND_CAPTURE_SAME_SCENE_BEFORE_AFTER\",\"VERIFY_PLAYER_FACING_EFFECT_AND_NO_SEMANTIC_REGRESSION\",\"PROMOTE_VERIFIED_BASELINE_OR_REPEAT\"],\"commonRules\":[\"AUDIT_ALL_APPLICABLE_PLAYER_FACING_TRACKS_EVERY_GENERATION\",\"RANK_AND_BUILD_THE_WEAKEST_THREE_BEFORE_ADDING_DECORATIVE_EXTRAS\",\"PRESENCE_OR_MARKER_ONLY_CANNOT_PASS_QUALITY\",\"IMPLEMENT_IN_THE_EXISTING_RESPONSIBLE_SYSTEM_NOT_A_SHADOW_WRAPPER\",\"COMPARE_BEFORE_AFTER_UNDER_THE_SAME_SCENE_INPUT_AND_STATE\",\"VERIFY_INPUT_TO_STATE_TO_MOTION_UI_AUDIO_VFX_CAMERA_FEEDBACK_CAUSALITY\",\"PRESERVE_GAMEPLAY_BALANCE_SAVE_ECONOMY_AND_NETWORK_AUTHORITY\",\"OWNER_INTENTIONALLY_DISABLED_AUDIO_CATEGORIES_MUST_REMAIN_DISABLED\",\"REPEAT_BUILD_UP_UNTIL_NO_CRITICAL_PLAYER_FACING_TRACK_GAP_REMAINS\"],\"platformProfile\":{\"attention\":\"EXTRA\",\"runtimeSurface\":\"OFFICIAL_ROBLOX_STUDIO_MCP\",\"requirements\":[\"ARTICULATED_ACTOR_MOTION_WITH_ANIMATOR_MOTOR6D_OR_BONES\",\"ROOT_ONLY_MOTION_CANNOT_PASS\",\"IDLE_WALK_JOG_RUN_START_STOP_TURN_JUMP_LAND_HIT_DEATH_COVERAGE_WHEN_APPLICABLE\",\"ANTICIPATION_IMPACT_RECOVERY_FOR_PRIMARY_ACTIONS\",\"TOUCH_FIRST_UI_WITH_MINIMUM_44PX_EQUIVALENT_TARGETS\",\"INVENTORY_COMPARE_EQUIP_UNEQUIP_REPLACE_FEEDBACK_WHEN_APPLICABLE\",\"SOUNDSERVICE_SOUNDGROUP_MIXING_AND_SPATIAL_ROLLOFF_WHEN_AUDIO_APPLICABLE\",\"REGION_OR_STATE_BGM_TRANSITION_WHEN_MULTIPLE_CONTEXTS_EXIST\",\"VFX_CAMERA_AUDIO_SHARE_AUTHORITATIVE_IMPACT_EVENT\",\"OFFICIAL_STUDIO_MCP_BEFORE_AFTER_RUNTIME_CAPTURE\"],\"ownerDisabledAudioCategoriesMustRemainDisabled\":true,\"nativeRuntimeEvidenceRequired\":true,\"mobileRuntimeEvidenceRequired\":true},\"robloxExtra\":{\"priority\":\"EXTRA_ATTENTION\",\"motion\":{\"articulatedActorsRequireJointMotion\":true,\"animatorMotor6dOrBonesRequiredWhenApplicable\":true,\"rootOnlyLocomotionCannotPass\":true,\"requiredStateIntent\":[\"IDLE\",\"WALK\",\"JOG\",\"RUN\",\"START\",\"STOP\",\"TURN\",\"JUMP\",\"LAND\",\"ATTACK_ANTICIPATION\",\"IMPACT\",\"RECOVERY\",\"HIT_REACTION\",\"DEATH\"],\"blendAndSpeedSyncRequired\":true,\"weightShiftAndSecondaryMotionRequired\":true,\"ikOrProceduralGroundingPreferred\":true},\"uiAndInventory\":{\"touchFirst\":true,\"minimumTouchTargetPxEquivalent\":44,\"safeAreaRequired\":true,\"modalStackBackCloseScrollSelectionPersistenceRequired\":true,\"inventoryFlowWhenApplicable\":[\"ACQUIRE\",\"COMPARE\",\"SELECT\",\"EQUIP\",\"UNEQUIP_OR_REPLACE\",\"CURRENT_EQUIPPED_INDICATOR\",\"WORLD_OR_CHARACTER_FEEDBACK\"]},\"audio\":{\"ownerDisabledCategoriesPreserved\":true,\"soundServiceLifecycleRequired\":true,\"soundGroupMixingPreferred\":true,\"spatialWorldAudioUsesRolloffWhenApplicable\":true,\"bgmRegionStateCombatTransitionsRequiredWhenMultipleContextsExist\":true,\"duplicatePlaybackOnRespawnOrResumeForbidden\":true,\"singleLoopAcrossDistinctContextsCannotClaimMusicBuildUp\":true},\"runtimeEvidence\":{\"officialStudioMcpRequired\":true,\"actualInputRequired\":true,\"beforeAfterCaptureRequired\":true,\"mobileViewportRequired\":true,\"runtimeStateObservationRequired\":true,\"sourceMarkersAloneCannotPass\":true}},\"webExtra\":null,\"unityExtra\":null,\"ownerLocks\":{\"gameplayBalanceSaveEconomyNetworkMeaningPreserved\":true,\"intentionallyDisabledAudioCategoriesPreserved\":true},\"designIdentity\":\"심야 대탈출. 증언과 합의된 현실·오만과 응보 감염 추격. 심야 대탈출에서 진영 전환과 추격 경로 × 증언과 합의된 현실과 정화와 팀 대응 × 오만과 응보이 서로 결과를 되돌려 바꾸며 감염 추격·미스터리의 판단이 실제 세계 상태를 변화시킨다.\"}\nUX_INPUT: 핵심 행동, 위험, 현재 목표, 다음 선택을 모바일 화면에서 우선순위가 명확하게 보이게 한다. | 터치 입력은 실제 게임 상태 변화에 연결하고 키보드/검증용 우회 입력이 모바일 PASS를 대신하지 못하게 한다. | 실패/재시도/복귀 시 플레이어가 무엇이 유지되고 무엇이 초기화되는지 즉시 알 수 있게 한다. | HUD·메뉴·인벤토리·장비·설정은 같은 UI 디자인 언어와 정보 우선순위를 사용하고 뒤로가기/닫기/스크롤/팝업 중첩을 모바일에서 검증한다. | 반복 조작은 편의 기능으로 줄이되 핵심 플레이 선택과 위험/보상 판단을 자동화하지 않는다.\nROBLOX_NATIVE_RESPONSIBLE_FILES: roblox-games/horror-escape-room/server/Game.server.luau | roblox-games/horror-escape-room/client/Game.client.luau | roblox-games/horror-escape-room/shared/GameConfig.luau | roblox-games/horror-escape-room/shared/RobloxCommonUI.luau | roblox-games/horror-escape-room/client/ManorLobby.client.luau | roblox-games/horror-escape-room/launch-mvp.json | roblox-games/horror-escape-room/server/ManorLobby.luau | roblox-games/horror-escape-room/shared/QACamera.luau | roblox-games/horror-escape-room/default.project.json | roblox-games/horror-escape-room/shared/RobloxCommonMaterials.luau | roblox-games/horror-escape-room/shared/Translations.luau | roblox-games/horror-escape-room/client/MaterialPresentation.client.luau\nROBLOX_NATIVE_SERVER_CLIENT: roblox-games/horror-escape-room/server/Game.server.luau:addMapUtility:SERVER_AUTHORITY | roblox-games/horror-escape-room/server/Game.server.luau:addEnergyCore:SERVER_AUTHORITY | roblox-games/horror-escape-room/server/Game.server.luau:addObjectiveStation:SERVER_AUTHORITY | roblox-games/horror-escape-room/server/Game.server.luau:infectPlayer:SERVER_AUTHORITY | roblox-games/horror-escape-room/client/Game.client.luau:verifiedLearningMotionFailureReason:CLIENT_INPUT_OR_PRESENTATION | roblox-games/horror-escape-room/client/Game.client.luau:combatSkinIdForPlayer:CLIENT_INPUT_OR_PRESENTATION | roblox-games/horror-escape-room/server/Game.server.luau:Room.selectLobbyMap:SERVER_AUTHORITY | roblox-games/horror-escape-room/client/Game.client.luau:verifiedLearningBindTrack:CLIENT_INPUT_OR_PRESENTATION\nROBLOX_NATIVE_FUNCTIONAL_ACCEPTANCE: input/touch -> local handler -> RemoteEvent/RemoteFunction when required -> server validation -> authoritative state change -> client feedback\nROBLOX_NATIVE_SOURCE_INSPECTION: SERVER_AUTHORITY,CLIENT_PRESENTATION,REMOTE_EVENTS_AND_FUNCTIONS,TOUCH_INPUT,CHARACTER_RESPAWN,DATASTORE_SAVE_LOAD,UI_STATE,CORE_STATE_MACHINE,MULTIPLAYER_SYNC\nROBLOX_NATIVE_CODE_QUALITY: NO_UNBOUNDED_WHILE_LOOP,NO_LEAKED_CONNECTIONS,NO_DUPLICATE_REMOTE_PATH,NO_CLIENT_AUTHORITATIVE_GAMEPLAY_MUTATION,BOUNDED_DATASTORE_RETRY,REMOTE_INPUT_VALIDATION,NO_STALE_CHARACTER_REFERENCE_AFTER_RESPAWN\nPRESERVE: 게임 제작은 Vibe와 승인된 AI 협업으로 진행한다. 검증된 내부 분석·게임 로직·전략선택·재조합·에셋 재사용 알고리즘을 과제 관련 범위에서 최대 활용한다. 외부 AI는 기존 승인·활성화 조건 아래 격리 후보 브랜치의 독립 책임 파일에 직접 구현·수리 가능하며 Vibe가 통합·학습한다. 중앙정책·QA·보안·배포 게이트를 유지하고 중복 파이프라인·미검증 주장은 금지한다. | 기존 세이브 키와 의미를 명시적 마이그레이션 없이 변경하지 않는다. | 승인 없는 밸런스/경제/보상/드랍/쿨다운/히트 의미 변경 금지. | 멀티플레이 권한과 authoritative state를 프레젠테이션 이유로 클라이언트로 이동하지 않는다. | wrapper/shadow/temporary override 대신 기존 책임 시스템을 직접 수정한다.\nACCEPTANCE: CURRENT_GAME_SOURCE_CHANGED_IN_RESPONSIBLE_SYSTEM | WORKFLOW_QA_HOMEPAGE_ONLY_CHANGE_DOES_NOT_COUNT | GAMEPLAY_CLAIM_REQUIRES_OBSERVABLE_GAME_STATE_DELTA | VISUAL_CLAIM_REQUIRES_ACTUAL_RENDERED_DELTA | BEFORE_AFTER_OR_VERIFIED_BASELINE_COMPARISON | NO_PROTECTED_SAVE_BALANCE_ECONOMY_NETWORK_SEMANTIC_REGRESSION | FOUNDATION_ONLY_REPAIR_COUNTS_ONLY_WHEN_FOUNDATION_IS_THIS_DIRECTIVE_PRIMARY_VERIFIED_GAP | HOLISTIC_CORE_DOMAINS_CLASSIFIED_PASS_GAP_OR_NOT_APPLICABLE | EXISTING_APPLICABLE_GAP_CANNOT_BE_SILENTLY_SKIPPED | FIRST_10_MINUTES_AND_SESSION_FLOW_REVIEWED | MAP_INVENTORY_UI_CONVENIENCE_AND_SYSTEM_CONNECTION_REVIEWED_WHEN_APPLICABLE | MOTION_UI_INVENTORY_AUDIO_VFX_CAMERA_WORLD_MOBILE_PERFORMANCE_TRACKS_REVIEWED | PRESENCE_ONLY_OR_MARKER_ONLY_CANNOT_CLOSE_PLAYER_FACING_QUALITY | SAME_SCENE_BEFORE_AFTER_RUNTIME_REOBSERVATION_REQUIRED_FOR_EXPERIENCE_BUILD_UP | ROBLOX_EXPERIENCE_BUILD_UP_USES_EXTRA_NATIVE_STUDIO_ATTENTION | AUTONOMOUS_CONTENT_EXPANSION_STAYS_INSIDE_EXISTING_BUILD_UP | CONTENT_EXPANSION_MUST_BE_COHERENT_CONNECTED_AND_NON_CLONE | GAME_IDENTITY_THREE_SENTENCE_TEST_PRESERVED_OR_STRENGTHENED | REPRESENTATIVE_ACTION_CHOICE_SIGNATURE_WORLD_RULE_AND_GROWTH_IDENTITY_REVIEWED | GENRE_PRIMARY_ACTION_PRESERVED_WITHOUT_FORCED_RPG_SYSTEMS | APPROVED_CAUSAL_GAME_GRAMMAR_PRESERVED_OR_MUTATED_WITH_REAL_STATE_EFFECT | MAIN_A_B_MAJOR_AXES_AND_c_SUB_ELEMENTS_ROLE_PRESERVED | AT_DELVE_LAYER_IS_NOT_GENERAL_SYSTEM_AXIS | EXISTING_GAME_GRAMMAR_DISCOVERED_FROM_CURRENT_DESIGN_AND_SOURCE_BEFORE_EXPANSION | CHARACTER_MONSTER_REGION_STORY_SHARE_CAUSAL_WORLD_LAW_WHEN_APPLICABLE | DESIGNED_SYSTEM_CONTENT_VOLUME_TRACED_TO_EXACT_SOURCE_AND_PLAY_EVIDENCE | EXISTING_COMPLETENESS_RECHECK_REQUIRED_EVERY_BUILD_UP | WEB_ROBLOX_UNITY_COMMON_EXPANSION_CONTRACT | PLAYER_FACING_APPLICABLE_SCENARIOS_REVIEW_REQUIRED | THUMBNAIL_TRANSPORT_CANNOT_CLOSE_VISUAL_QUALITY | MISSING_EXACT_RENDER_EVIDENCE_REMAINS_UNVERIFIED\nNEXT_ESCALATION: DEEPEN_CORE_FUN_DECISION_DENSITY | CONNECT_VISUAL_LANGUAGE_TO_GAMEPLAY_TELEGRAPH_AND_WORLD_IDENTITY | CLOSE_NEXT_HIGHEST_VALUE_GAP_FROM_RUNTIME_OR_PLAYTEST | OPTIMIZE_MOBILE_FRAME_INPUT_RENDER_OR_STATE_BOTTLENECK_WHEN_VERIFIED\n[DESIGN_IMPLEMENTATION_FLOW] 구현 순서는 MAIN 첫 플레이→A↔B 공유 상태와 선택의 결과→c/@ 변형과 성장→해당 컨셉의 배경·연출이다. 이미 실측된 차단 오류는 먼저 수리하고, 필수 설계 항목의 GAP가 남았으면 무관한 장식 확장으로 회차를 소비하지 않는다. 오토 바이옴은 승인된 동일 게임 공간 설계의 지형·바이옴·기후·동선·랜드마크·예약 영역을 기존 생성 도구에 전달하고 전경/플레이 중경/원경을 실제 Luau 소스에 구현한다. 설계 공간 정보가 없으면 임의 기본 숲을 적용하지 말고 기존 설계 보완 경로로 돌린다. MAIN/A/B/c/@ 설계 원본의 규칙 ID와 기준선 버전을 실제 Luau 파일·책임 함수·입력/상태 전이/출력 및 같은 빌드의 플레이 시나리오에 대응시킨다. 장르 핵심 루프, 컨셉·세계·스토리 진행, 시스템 연결·실패 복구, 그래픽·모션·VFX·오디오·UI, 첫 플레이→세션 완료→재도전→필요한 저장 복구를 PASS/GAP/NOT_APPLICABLE로 근거와 함께 판정한다. 실제 플레이의 첫 진입·진행·실패·재도전 화면을 같은 소스/패키지에 묶고 기존 golden scene 및 runtimeVisualReview 픽셀 검사로 자산 누락·UI 겹침·잘림·가독성·스타일을 검수한다. 캐릭터 동작은 연속 프레임/실행 증거로 검증하고 정지 이미지로 동작 성공을 주장하지 않는다. 썸네일·생성 이미지·메타데이터는 실제 플레이 화면 증거를 대신하지 못한다. 발견한 문제는 기존 BUILD_UP 책임 소스에 연결해 수정한 뒤 같은 화면에서 재촬영한다. 현재 책임 범위의 GAP를 실제 구현하고 다음 GAP를 기존 BUILD_UP에 연결한다. 소스 검사·작업 시간·학습 기록만으로 실제 플레이 GAP를 닫지 않는다. 동일 소스/패키지의 기존 F0~F9 검증을 유지하고 검증 학습 재사용도 새 빌드에서 재검증한다.","responsibleFiles":["roblox-games/horror-escape-room/server/Game.server.luau","roblox-games/horror-escape-room/client/Game.client.luau","roblox-games/horror-escape-room/shared/GameConfig.luau"],"retainedResponsibleFileLocks":["roblox-games/horror-escape-room/server/Game.server.luau","roblox-games/horror-escape-room/client/Game.client.luau","roblox-games/horror-escape-room/shared/GameConfig.luau"],"dependencies":[],"priority":"critical","portfolioValueScore":0,"ownerDevelopmentHold":false,"releaseState":"release-confirmed","status":"queued","retries":0,"retryPolicy":"UNLIMITED_CAUSAL_REPAIR","maxRetries":null,"ownerDirective":false,"requiresOwnerDecision":false,"protectedChange":false,"paidResourceRequired":false,"productionMode":"AUTONOMOUS_VIBE","supervisionApproved":false,"supervisionContract":null,"supervisionReview":null,"blocker":null,"evidence":["post-release-focused:yes","focus-release-kind:INTERNAL_PLATFORM_RELEASE","internal-release-focused:yes","published-release-version:21","published-release-source:294311358d51d510f8ca60283632ad5f819afc17","published-release-artifact:sha256:a298a9bdc3e5b0469d3b5a7adcdfd01da5b0ddc9ce19423631098e1668b1b236","release-place-id:","post-release-source-tree-sha256:4048dd962de0ea8d1b89d97130612dc3142f65d5d1a1499f7a9ccaa479610765","central-policy:company-learning/platform-release-roadmap.json","system-ai-caretaker-game:horror-escape-room","caretaker-logical-owner:STICKY","caretaker-worker-handoff:REPLACE_WORKER_RESUME_EXACT_CHECKPOINT","recombination-recipe:recombine_6d561628435c78d7","learning-motor-candidate-tournament:repeated-verified-failure","recovery-queue:recovery-ticket-bug-b021616100dca0c3a206","recovery-strategy:REPAIR_REPRODUCIBLE_TESTER_BUG_AND_RERUN_EXACT_FAILED_STAGE","recovery-exact-stage:F0_SOURCE_INTEGRITY","source-mutation-required:YES","game-repair-mode:FOCUSED_REPAIR","game-repair-repeat-count:2","game-repair-user-assistance-required:NO","game-repair-save-migration:NOT_APPLICABLE","game-repair-multiplayer-lifecycle:NOT_APPLICABLE","portfol